sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    participant C1 as Cliente A
    participant C2 as Cliente B
    participant API as API REST
    participant RS as ReservationService
    participant REPO as ReservationRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C1,DB: Cenário 1: Reserva bem-sucedida

    C1->>API: POST /api/reservations
    API->>RS: create(userId, spaceId, reservationDate)
    RS->>RS: ensureUserExists()
    RS->>RS: ensureSpaceExists()
    RS->>REPO: findBySpaceAndDate(spaceId, reservationDate)
    REPO->>DB: SELECT * FROM reservations WHERE space_id = ? AND reservation_date = ?
    DB-->>REPO: null (nenhuma reserva)
    REPO-->>RS: null
    RS->>REPO: create(reservation)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT INTO reservations
    DB-->>REPO: OK
    REPO-->>RS: Reservation
    RS-->>API: Reservation
    API-->>C1: 201 Created

    Note over C1,DB: Cenário 2: Double-booking bloqueado

    C2->>API: POST /api/reservations (mesmo espaço/data)
    API->>RS: create(userId, spaceId, reservationDate)
    RS->>RS: ensureUserExists()
    RS->>RS: ensureSpaceExists()
    RS->>REPO: findBySpaceAndDate(spaceId, reservationDate)
    REPO->>DB: SELECT * FROM reservations WHERE space_id = ? AND reservation_date = ?
    DB-->>REPO: Reservation existente
    REPO-->>RS: Reservation (conflito!)
    RS--xAPI: AppError(409, "Espaço já reservado nesse dia.")
    API--xC2: 409 Conflict
